Vulkan on Android: surface creation and zero-cost pre-rotation.

Blender-owned files; every hunk is enclosed in "UPBGE - Android" comments
so merges from Blender show at a glance what is ours.

- GHOST_ContextVK: VK_KHR_android_surface platform (the ANativeWindow travels
  in the X11 window slot), swapchain pre-rotation (identity extent,
  preTransform = currentTransform, STORAGE usage) with compositor fallback,
  SUBOPTIMAL handling, INHERIT composite alpha fallback.
- GHOST_Types: GHOST_VulkanSwapChainData::pre_transform.
- volk: load the Android surface entry point.
- gpu/vulkan: logical-orientation back buffer and a rotating compute copy
  into the swapchain (vk_backbuffer_rotate), in place of the blit.

Base: UPBGE master 42b4210c153769f44c262fdeab6f0f805a551911
Apply: scripts/apply_patches.sh (patch -p1 in the UPBGE checkout)

